体系、运行机制到企业文化等多方面着手，逐步构建起覆盖全方位的合规管理体系。</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"management\">\n        <h2>管理架构</h2>\n        <p>依托于三道防线的建设，我们不断完善相关机制，大力推进合规风险的识别、评估与防控工作落地。</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"system\">\n        <div class=\"system-title\">合规管理体系</div>\n        <div class=\"system-banner\">美的集团合规管理三道防线</div>\n        <div class=\"defense-lines\">\n          <article class=\"defense-line\">\n            <div class=\"line-label\">第一道防线</div>\n            <div class=\"connector\"></div>\n            <div class=\"defense-card\">\n              <div class=\"defense-card-inner\">\n                <div class=\"icon\">♙</div>\n                <div class=\"card-title\">管理者、员工</div>\n                <div class=\"card-copy\">合规风险所有者、管理者，<br>负责本业务部门合规风险识<br>别、评估、处置等</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"defense-line\">\n            <div class=\"line-label\">第二道防线</div>\n            <div class=\"connector\"></div>\n            <div class=\"defense-card\">\n              <div class=\"defense-card-inner\">\n                <div class=\"icon\">♧</div>\n                <div class=\"card-title\">合规专门组织</div>\n                <div class=\"card-copy\">牵头统筹协调、组织推动、<br>督促落实</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"defense-line\">\n            <div class=\"line-label\">第三道防线</div>\n            <div class=\"connector\"></div>\n            <div class=\"defense-card\">\n              <div class=\"defense-card-inner\">\n                <div class=\"icon\">✎</div>\n                <div class=\"card-title\">审计、调查、稽查</div>\n                <div class=\"card-copy\">监督与持续改进</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"page-number\">115</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"page page-right\">\n      <header class=\"header\">\n        <nav class=\"nav\">\n          <span>关于本报告</span>\n          <span>走进美的</span>\n          <span>可持续发展治理</span>\n          <span>守护蓝色星球</span>\n          <span>构建和谐社区</span>\n          <span>践行科技尽善</span>\n          <span class=\"active\">共创繁荣生态</span>\n          <span>附录</span>\n        </nav>\n      </header>\n\n      <section class=\"cert-panel\">\n        <p class=\"cert-copy\">为持续完善合规体系建设和不断提升合规管理能力，美的集团由法务大合规中心和中国区域法务团队统筹，信息安全部门协助，成功获得ISO 37301:2021合规管理体系认证。该认证彰显了美的集团在合规管理方面的成熟度和专业水准，同时也为美的集团业务的持续稳健发展提供了坚实的基础。</p>\n        <div class=\"placeholder certificate\">[Certificate of Registration]</div>\n        <div class=\"cert-note\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>ISO 37301：2021合规管理体系认证</div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"mechanism\">\n        <h2>管理制度与运行机制</h2>\n        <p>为强化合规管理，美的集团：</p>\n\n        <div class=\"mechanism-rows\">\n          <div class=\"mechanism-row\">\n            <div class=\"mechanism-label\">建立动态风险<br>防控机制</div>\n            <div class=\"arrow\"></div>\n            <div class=\"mechanism-copy\">定期开展风险自评，结合法律研究与风险预警体系，构建“信息收集 - 风险标注 - 政策解读 - 预警发布 - 升级推送 - 反馈处理”闭环机制。</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mechanism-row\">\n            <div class=\"mechanism-label\">推进数字化合规建设</div>\n            <div class=\"arrow\"></div>\n            <div class=\"mechanism-copy\">开发合规数字化系统，集成普通性服务功能与定制化场景解决方案，实现合规要求与业务流程深度融合。</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mechanism-row\">\n            <div class=\"mechanism-label\">深化重点领域合规</div>\n            <div class=\"arrow\"></div>\n            <div class=\"mechanism-copy\">2024 年持续强化贸易合规与数据合规建设，进一步夯实管理基础，确保全球监管适应性。</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"page-number\">116</div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
